    {
      "id": "yqRsOWsn0dCxWpvga37hF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1155.5801087505463,
      "y": 973.818028302756,
      "width": 1861.19921875,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1995071982,
      "version": 477,
      "versionNonce": 201387122,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785348407629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Book My Show\n\nFlow - User will come to platform, user will search for movie or city, All available theatres \nwill be shown. User will select a particular theatre\n\nUser -> Search movie/city -> List of theatres\nSelect a theatre -> List of shows\nShows -> Select any show -> Available seats\nBook Seat -> Payment\nMaje karo\n\n\nDiagram -  \n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Book My Show\n\nFlow - User will come to platform, user will search for movie or city, All available theatres \nwill be shown. User will select a particular theatre\n\nUser -> Search movie/city -> List of theatres\nSelect a theatre -> List of shows\nShows -> Select any show -> Available seats\nBook Seat -> Payment\nMaje karo\n\n\nDiagram -  \n",
