    {
      "id": "-jFRJopuh5sdKSvjRKf5F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2011.7219523074807,
      "y": 10024.03677447397,
      "width": 1069.1993408203125,
      "height": 1035,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fefeff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1263028638,
      "version": 798,
      "versionNonce": 536902687,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789643803346,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Google Docs LLD\n\nFlow - \n1. User will come to application\n2. User can open/create one document\n3. Multiple users can do changes simultaneously\n4. Managing those changes\n5. Insert and delete text\n6. See active user and cursor position\n7. Save document\n8. Saving different versions of document. (Versioning)\n9. Basic permissions - owner/viewer/editor\n\nEntities\n1. User\n2. Document\n3. DocumentVersion (Store state of document?????)\n4. DocumentSession\n5. Participant\n6. Role (Enum)\n7. OperationType \n8. Cursor Position??????\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Google Docs LLD\n\nFlow - \n1. User will come to application\n2. User can open/create one document\n3. Multiple users can do changes simultaneously\n4. Managing those changes\n5. Insert and delete text\n6. See active user and cursor position\n7. Save document\n8. Saving different versions of document. (Versioning)\n9. Basic permissions - owner/viewer/editor\n\nEntities\n1. User\n2. Document\n3. DocumentVersion (Store state of document?????)\n4. DocumentSession\n5. Participant\n6. Role (Enum)\n7. OperationType \n8. Cursor Position??????\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
