      "text": "SplitWise LLD - \n\nFlow - \nUser comes to application\nUser can add friends\nUsers can create/manage groups\nUsers can add friend inside group\nManage expenses inside a group/ outside a group\nCan split expenses (Equal/ Unequal/ Percentage wise)\nBalancesheet of each user\n\nClasses\nUser\nGroup\nExpense\nSplit\nBalanceSheet\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SplitWise LLD - \n\nFlow - \nUser comes to application\nUser can add friends\nUsers can create/manage groups\nUsers can add friend inside group\nManage expenses inside a group/ outside a group\nCan split expenses (Equal/ Unequal/ Percentage wise)\nBalancesheet of each user\n\nClasses\nUser\nGroup\nExpense\nSplit\nBalanceSheet\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
